    "q-78193": {
      "dom_id": "step-q78193",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "What is the coefficient of $v{w}^{2}$ in the product $(v+w)({v}^{2}+4vw+{w}^{2})?$",
      "worked_solution": "We distribute both terms of the binomial in the first set of parentheses to the trinomial in the second set of parentheses. Then, we simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(v+w)({v}^{2}+4vw+{w}^{2}) & = \\\\ v({v}^{2}+4vw+{w}^{2})+w({v}^{2}+4vw+{w}^{2}) & = \\\\ {v}^{3}+4{v}^{2}w+v{w}^{2}+{v}^{2}w+4v{w}^{2}+{w}^{3} & = \\\\ {v}^{3}+5{v}^{2}w+5v{w}^{2}+{w}^{3} & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coefficient of $v{w}^{2}$ is $5.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
